%description:
A UE that leaves its cell while an uplink grant of that cell is pending makes no PDU for it:
the grant goes with the cell.

One gNB on two carriers, of numerology 0 and 2, so the UE's MAC ticks every 0.25 ms, and a grant
on the 2 GHz carrier, which reaches the UE right after a tick, waits up to 1 ms for that
carrier's next turn. The UE sends a saturating uplink flow and moves away from the gNB at 100
m/s; with minRssi = 35 dB it loses the cell on the way. handoverDetachmentTime = 23.5 ms puts
its detachment, at 3.02351 s, between a grant's arrival at 3.023 s and its turn at 3.024 s.

The UE's MAC, detached, then found the grant at its next turn, made a PDU for a pending buffer
status report, and aborted on the missing cell ("check_and_cast(): Cannot cast nullptr to type
'simu5g::LteMacBase*'"). The same happened, depending on the seed, to the NR leg of a dual
connectivity UE in nr/test_numerology, when a handover of its master forced the leg to detach.

The run reaches its time limit.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork
sim-time-limit = 4s

*.carrierAggregation.numComponentCarriers = 2
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].carrierFrequency = 2GHz
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].numerologyIndex = 0
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1].carrierFrequency = 6GHz
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1].numerologyIndex = 2
*.gnb.cellularNic.numCarriers = 2
*.gnb.cellularNic.phy.componentCarrierModules = "carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0] carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1]"
*.ue[*].cellularNic.nrPhy.componentCarrierModules = "carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0] carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1]"

# the UE moves away from the gNB and loses it
*.gnb.mobility.initialX = 100m
*.gnb.mobility.initialY = 500m
*.ue[*].mobility.typename = "LinearMobility"
*.ue[*].mobility.initialX = 150m
*.ue[*].mobility.initialY = 500m
*.ue[*].mobility.speed = 100mps
*.ue[*].mobility.initialMovementHeading = 0deg
**.shadowing = false
**.fading = false
**.dynamicLos = false
**.enableHandover = true
**.cellInfo.beaconInterval = 0.1s
**.minRssiDefault = false
**.minRssi = 35dB
**.handoverDetachmentTime = 23.5ms
*.ue[0].cellularNic.rrc.nrConnectionControl.**.vector-recording = true

# a saturating uplink flow
*.ue[*].numApps = 1
*.ue[*].app[0].typename = "CbrSender"
*.ue[*].app[0].destAddress = "server"
*.ue[*].app[0].destPort = 1000
*.ue[*].app[0].packetSize = 1000B
*.ue[*].app[0].samplingTime = 0.25ms
*.ue[*].app[0].startTime = 0.05s
*.server.numApps = 1
*.server.app[0].typename = "CbrReceiver"
*.server.app[0].localPort = 1000

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Simulation time limit reached
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
